- standardCode: the standard number (1-21) as a string, or null if unmatched
- standardTitle: the title of the matched standard, or null if unmatched
- subspecificationCode: the subspecification letter (a-f) as a string, or null if unmatched/unknown
- subspecificationTitle: the title of the matched subspecification, or null if unmatched
- confidence: your confidence level from 0-100 as a number
- rationale: A detailed explanation (2-4 sentences) of WHY this section matches or doesn't match. Reference specific content from BOTH the section AND the specification.`;

// Build the OpenAI API request body
const openaiRequestBody = JSON.stringify({
  model: 'gpt-4o-mini',
  messages: [
    { role: 'system', content: systemMessage },
